  "qualifications": [
    "The independent runtime scope is the exact linked local source, mathematical, state, and pin-delta review. The complete genuine owned tiny execution belongs to fb0a92; the distinct b818 fixture-only successor has a genuine narrow two-batch proof. The final 2490998d source is an independently verified three-pin/prose delta, not a relabelled full owned run.",
    "The dataset derives from authenticated v25 target-free solver bytes with only two exact escrow-path substitutions. Dev and holdout escrow bodies were byte-hashed without parsing. No PUBLIC target material was copied into this release review.",
