    "Raw wrapper predicates were independently tested on retained actual no-model process proofs. High-level JIT, interpreter, and runtime integration documents are explicitly synthetic test bindings. These are not positive provider admission evidence.",
    "The frozen deployment permits clean full or partial-comparison PUBLIC-sealed mechanics without promoting comparison completeness. Invalid raw wrapper closure must reject every externally dependent admission and goal alias. A valid wrapper with provider ERROR remains eligible for independently verified scientific evidence while operational success is false.",
